lines=['# R7 five-category MLE audit and bounded U/K/source optimization','',f"Candidate: `{F['candidate']}`; baseline: `{F['baseline']}`.",'`production_gate=BLOCKED_CRYPTOGRAPHIC_DESIGN`; `may_enter_stage2=false`. This is an implementation/performance candidate, not cryptographic production acceptance.','Fixed verified workspace: `/home/yttan/project/zkGPT/zkGPT-main/zkGPT-work`. The shorter path in the task attachment was absent. Candidate/source/parameter/dependency bytes matched the prior accepted snapshot; PERF6 and the original main repository were preserved. See BASELINE_IDENTITY.json and BASELINE_GIT_RESULT.json.','','## 1. MLE mathematical audit','','For global z, chi_z(r)=product_b (r_b if bit_b(z)=1 else 1-r_b). The contribution of category c is sum over z in [b_c,b_c+n_c) of U[z] chi_z(r). A category-local MLE is insufficient at an arbitrary offset.','Each storage actual interval is greedily partitioned into positive, globally aligned dyadic tiles of size <=2^20. Advancing the end of each tile proves coverage and disjointness; tile selection never crosses a storage actual boundary or adds padded cells. Chunk/category/global zero gaps remain implicit. For tile a divisible by 2^ell, chi_(a+j)=selector(a,ell,r_high)*chi_j(r_low).','Local folds contract low bits with the same challenges. Once tiles collapse to the same global suffix coordinate, BOTH U and K scalars are summed before their quadratic product; this preserves cross terms across chunks/tiles/categories. Source maps use absolute global coordinates. Compact physical matrix coefficients in single_hyrax.cpp mappedQueryTerms preserve row carry; category and matrix tails are zero. See MLE_AUDIT.md.','The new verifier K endpoint computes sum_i rho_i sum_nonconstant_j chi_j(source_point_i)*chi_(phi_i(j))(global_point). Aligned simple blocks reuse TerminalBasis. For power-of-two logical steps and positive/negative power strides, source quotient-aligned blocks use a two-state carry/borrow recurrence for exact joint bit products at arbitrarily unaligned global coordinates. Zero stride sums free source weights to one. Non-power steps/strides and short blocks enumerate exact terms. See CARRY_MLE_AUDIT.md and2200 mixed-dimension,Boolean/signed,32-bit boundary and invalid-range tests. No division, no witness-dependent admission, no changes to bias removal, claims, messages or challenge order. Callback fallback hashes the exact consumed map and rejects mutation.','Tests: 220 seeded arbitrary-offset cases, 1,528 round comparisons, Dense==Streaming==Cached every round; local U/K folds, endpoint and physical mapped coefficients; empty/one/power/nonpower categories, small chunks, zero tails and 0/1/negative points. A further 220 K endpoint cases cover positive/negative/zero stride, step omissions, repeats, bias, cross-category and changed maps. A real bounded larger proof is replayed by dense and direct witness-free V paths with identical frame count and transcript prefix.','Full Release CTest: **119/119 PASS** (ctest-carry-final.log). Actual bounded X algebraic negatives, omitted claim/modified handle/PC/map probes passed. Full Oneblock/Full12 malicious CLI proof attacks: **NOT_RUN**; bounded attacks are not represented as full-scale attacks.','','## 2. U Scan attribution','','Historical 13.7849s (PERF4) and 536.0176s (five-category) are not controlled A/B: the former also had a separately timed 29.4731s retained-state fold, different rounds/configuration, and 11,576,840,712 retained capacity bytes. The latter bypassed retained state for callback inputs and repeatedly contracted original U in u_streaming.cpp quadraticRoundStreaming/Weights::dot. category_auth.cpp provides scalar callback Inputs; legacy pointer-backed FoldedU did not retain them.','Historical five-category counters: 30 rounds, 21,426,524,640 U coordinates, 685,648,788,480 scalar payload bytes, 20,712,447,656 contraction Fr multiplications and 21,426,690,816 additions. Historical scan CPU1173.4177s differs from wall536.0176s because worker work overlaps. These bytes are scalar payload demand, not DRAM/disk traffic. See HISTORICAL_U_ATTRIBUTION.json and original raw log references.','Final FoldedU admits only a derived tile level whose actual lengths plus metadata fit 512MiB. It captures contractions already computed by the admission-round scan, then folds retained tile vectors in place after each challenge. No extra original scan, full U/val0 copy, global padding vector or private U file. PERF4_U_STATE.original_read_coordinates covers state advance only; deferred admission reuses scan reads, reported by U_SCAN_DETAIL instead. Immutable storage token/offset/bounds bind each borrowed reader; retained descriptors do not own allocating callbacks. Failed lifecycle/admission poisons state.','Tile geometry is enumerated once per authentication. Weight tables are shared by prefix width within each scan round, not reused across distinct sampled prefixes. The new cache removes later original contractions and their weight reconstruction. Source claims and authentication identities remain distinct.','All strict runs have read-profile0. Separate Full12 D1 uses baseline U/K plus read-profile1; it is excluded from medians. Optional <=1024-Fr profiling buffers measure reading+mapping jointly without changing original callback call counts. Small contractions are untimed; CPU residual includes their reading, Fr operations and dispatch. Physical chunk read/cache traffic is **NOT_MEASURED_NO_BULK_CHUNK_API**, never zero. Current U readers are resident scalar readers; U explicit file IO is zero. Exact original/retained reads, descriptor counts, coverage and operations are reported.','One early diagnostic prefetch bug amplified reads; it was stopped, retained as failed Oneblock A1, reproduced RED and corrected with exact callback-count GREEN tests. The strict final Oneblock v2 A samples are A1/A2/A3 in ab-v2. All v1 ab/* runs are superseded diagnostics after measured endpoint eligibility22.3%; final ab-v2 samples use a fresh single-binary freeze with carry/borrow endpoint, whose old whole Oneblock proof replay admitted98.4% and passed all5346 coverage relations. No failed or superseded run is counted in final medians.','','## 3. Algorithms, reads, cache and memory','','Times below are seconds, displayed as median [min,max]; spread. Counts and bytes use the same format. Complete per-run/per-round counters are in PERFORMANCE_SUMMARY.json. U scan is inside Unified Sumcheck; state capture, advance folds, K access and products are separate subphases inside that same enclosing timer. Do not add nested totals twice.','']
